@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiPath = /api/v1/vehicules
@vehiculeId = 0b4cfe43-9653-47dc-ac81-88983fd778cb

### Notes
# 1. Start the service before running these requests.
# 2. Security is currently disabled in application.yml, so no Authorization header is needed.
# 3. Replace {{vehiculeId}} with a real UUID returned by the create request when needed.

### 1) Health check - list all vehicles
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}
Accept: application/json

### 2) Create vehicle - success
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "AA-123-AA",
  "marque": "Renault",
  "modele": "Clio",
  "annee": 2024,
  "typeCarburant": "ESSENCE"
}

### 3) Create second vehicle - success
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "BB-456-BB",
  "marque": "Peugeot",
  "modele": "208",
  "annee": 2023,
  "typeCarburant": "DIESEL"
}

### 4) Create vehicle - duplicate immatriculation should return 409
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "aa-123-aa",
  "marque": "Renault",
  "modele": "Megane",
  "annee": 2022,
  "typeCarburant": "HYBRIDE"
}

### 5) Create vehicle - invalid body should return 422
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": " ",
  "marque": "",
  "modele": "",
  "annee": 1980,
  "typeCarburant": null
}

### 6) List vehicles - pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 7) List vehicles - filter by marque
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}?marque=Renault
Accept: application/json

### 8) List vehicles - filter by statut
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}?statut=DISPONIBLE
Accept: application/json

### 9) List vehicles - invalid page size should return 400
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}?size=101
Accept: application/json

### 10) Get vehicle by id - success
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}
Accept: application/json

### 11) Get vehicle by id - invalid UUID should return 400
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/not-a-uuid
Accept: application/json

### 12) Get vehicle by id - unknown UUID should return 404
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Accept: application/json

### 13) Update vehicle - success
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "marque": "Citroen",
  "modele": "C4",
  "annee": 2025,
  "typeCarburant": "HYBRIDE",
  "kilometrage": 42000
}

### 14) Update vehicle - partial update success
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "kilometrage": 45000
}

### 15) Update vehicle - blank marque should return 422
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "marque": "   "
}

### 16) Update vehicle - negative kilometrage should return 422
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "kilometrage": -1
}

### 17) Change status - success
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}/statut
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "statut": "EN_MAINTENANCE",
  "motif": "Revision periodique"
}

### 18) Change status - second valid transition
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}/statut
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "statut": "EN_SERVICE",
  "motif": "Retour en service"
}

### 19) Change status - same current status should return 422
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}/statut
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "statut": "EN_SERVICE"
}

### 20) Change status - invalid enum should return 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}/statut
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "statut": "BROKEN_STATUS"
}

### 21) Get vehicle status history
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}/historique?page=0&size=20
Accept: application/json

### 22) Get vehicle history - invalid size should return 400
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}/historique?page=0&size=101
Accept: application/json

### 23) Soft delete vehicle
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}
Accept: application/json

### 24) Get deleted vehicle - should return 404
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}
Accept: application/json

### 25) Delete already deleted vehicle - should return 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/{{vehiculeId}}
Accept: application/json
